    "Your next free painting comes tomorrow. One purchase unlocks the drawing tools and as many new paintings as you like." : {
      "comment" : "The Unlimited Paintings sheet opened by Start Painting with no free painting left, in builds where every new painting takes one (1.1)",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein nächstes kostenloses Bild kommt morgen. Ein einziger Kauf schaltet die Zeichenwerkzeuge frei und so viele neue Bilder, wie du möchtest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu próximo cuadro gratis llega mañana. Una sola compra desbloquea las herramientas de dibujo y todos los cuadros nuevos que quieras."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre prochain tableau gratuit arrive demain. Un seul achat débloque les outils de dessin et autant de nouveaux tableaux que vous voulez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il prossimo quadro gratuito arriva domani. Un solo acquisto sblocca gli strumenti di disegno e tutti i nuovi quadri che vuoi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次の無料の絵は明日届きます。一度の購入で、描画ツールと好きなだけの新しい絵が使えるようになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다음 무료 그림은 내일 생겨요. 한 번 구입하면 그리기 도구와 원하는 만큼의 새 그림이 열려요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je volgende gratis schilderij komt morgen. Met één aankoop ontgrendel je het tekengereedschap en zoveel nieuwe schilderijen als je wilt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sua próxima pintura gratuita chega amanhã. Uma única compra libera as ferramentas de desenho e quantas pinturas novas você quiser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明天会有下一次免费画作。一次购买，即可解锁绘图工具，新画作想画多少就画多少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下一幅免費畫作明天就會來。一次購買即可解鎖繪圖工具，並隨你畫多少幅新畫作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
