      }
    },
    "Hold Show Photo to see the original. Tap it to keep it showing." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the tip titled Peek at the Photo, about the painting screen’s Photo control, which shows the photo the painting was made from",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte „Foto zeigen“ gedrückt, um das Original zu sehen. Tippe darauf, damit es sichtbar bleibt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantén pulsado Mostrar foto para ver el original. Tócalo para que siga visible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maintenez Afficher la photo pour voir l’original. Touchez-le pour la garder affichée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuto Mostra foto per vedere l’originale. Toccalo per lasciarla visibile."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「写真を表示」を押し続けると元の写真が見えます。タップすると表示したままになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사진 보기를 길게 누르면 원본이 보여요. 탭하면 계속 보여요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Houd Toon foto vast om het origineel te zien. Tik erop om de foto te laten staan."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenha Mostrar foto pressionado para ver o original. Toque para deixar à mostra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住“显示照片”可以查看原图。轻点它可让照片保持显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住「顯示照片」可以看原圖。點一下則會讓它持續顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In More, Give Feedback lets you mark the page and say what is wrong or right." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the tip titled Tell Us What You Think; More is the painting screen’s menu button, Give Feedback one of its items",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unter „Mehr“ kannst du mit „Feedback geben“ das Blatt markieren und sagen, was nicht stimmt oder was gut ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Más, Enviar comentarios te permite marcar la página y decir qué está mal o qué está bien."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Plus, Envoyer des commentaires vous permet d’annoter la page et de dire ce qui va ou ne va pas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Altro, Invia feedback ti permette di segnare la pagina e dire cosa non va o cosa funziona."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「その他」の「フィードバックを送る」で、ページに印をつけて、よくない所やよい所を伝えられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "더 보기의 피드백 보내기에서 페이지에 표시하고 무엇이 좋고 아쉬운지 말해 줄 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Meer kun je met Geef feedback het blad markeren en zeggen wat er mis of goed is."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Em Mais, Dar feedback permite marcar a página e dizer o que está errado ou certo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“更多”中，“提供反馈”让你可以在画页上做标记，说说哪里不好、哪里不错。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「更多」中，「提供意見回饋」可讓你在頁面上做記號，說說哪裡不對、哪裡很好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In More, Zen Mode moves the page to the next area after each fill." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the tip titled A Calmer Way to Paint; More is the painting screen’s menu button, Zen Mode one of its items",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unter „Mehr“ führt dich der Zen-Modus nach jedem Füllen zur nächsten Fläche."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Más, Modo Zen lleva la página a la siguiente zona después de cada relleno."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Plus, le mode zen amène la page à la zone suivante après chaque remplissage."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Altro, la Modalità Zen porta la pagina all’area successiva dopo ogni riempimento."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「その他」の「禅モード」をオンにすると、塗るたびに次のエリアへ移動します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "더 보기의 젠 모드는 한 곳을 칠할 때마다 다음 영역으로 페이지를 옮겨 줘요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Meer schuift Zen-modus het blad na elke vulling naar het volgende vlak."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Em Mais, o Modo Zen leva a página para a próxima área depois de cada preenchimento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“更多”中，“禅模式”会在每次填色后把画页移到下一个区域。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「更多」中，「禪模式」會在每次上色後把頁面移到下一個區塊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
