    "These settings were picked for this photo. You can just tap Start Painting." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the tip titled Already Chosen for You; Start Painting is the New Painting screen’s main button",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Einstellungen wurden für dieses Foto gewählt. Du kannst einfach auf „Losmalen“ tippen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos ajustes se eligieron para esta foto. Solo tienes que tocar Empezar a pintar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ces réglages ont été choisis pour cette photo. Vous pouvez simplement toucher Commencer à peindre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Queste impostazioni sono state scelte per questa foto. Puoi semplicemente toccare Inizia a dipingere."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この写真に合わせて設定を選んであります。そのまま「塗りはじめる」をタップしても大丈夫です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 사진에 맞게 고른 설정이에요. 칠하기 시작만 누르면 돼요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze instellingen zijn voor deze foto gekozen. Je kunt gewoon op Begin met schilderen tikken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estes ajustes foram escolhidos para esta foto. É só tocar em Começar a pintar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置是为这张照片挑选的。你直接轻点“开始涂色”就好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些設定是為這張照片挑選的。你只要點「開始作畫」就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
