    "Tips appear beside things as you reach them, one at a time. Turn them off here whenever you like." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the Settings section with the Tips switch and Show Tips Again",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tipps erscheinen nacheinander neben den Dingen, sobald du zu ihnen kommst. Schalte sie hier aus, wann immer du magst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los consejos aparecen junto a las cosas a medida que llegas a ellas, de uno en uno. Desactívalos aquí cuando quieras."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les astuces apparaissent à côté des choses quand vous y arrivez, une à la fois. Désactivez-les ici quand vous voulez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I consigli compaiono accanto alle cose quando ci arrivi, uno alla volta. Puoi disattivarli qui quando vuoi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ヒントは、その場所にたどり着いたときに、ひとつずつ横に表示されます。ここでいつでもオフにできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "팁은 해당 기능에 처음 닿을 때 옆에 하나씩 나타나요. 언제든 여기서 끌 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips verschijnen naast dingen zodra je er komt, één tegelijk. Je kunt ze hier uitzetten wanneer je wilt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As dicas aparecem ao lado das coisas conforme você chega nelas, uma por vez. Desative aqui quando quiser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小提示会在你用到某样东西时出现在它旁边，一次一条。你随时可以在这里关闭它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提示會在你用到某樣東西時出現在旁邊，一次一則。你隨時可以在這裡關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
