    "Your photos and paintings stay on this device unless you share them or choose to send feedback. Paint by Moonlight has no accounts, ads or tracking." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the About section in Settings: the privacy statement",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Fotos und Bilder bleiben auf diesem Gerät, außer du teilst sie oder schickst uns Feedback. Paint by Moonlight hat keine Accounts, keine Werbung und kein Tracking."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus fotos y cuadros se quedan en este dispositivo, salvo que los compartas o decidas enviar comentarios. Paint by Moonlight no tiene cuentas, anuncios ni rastreo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos photos et vos tableaux restent sur cet appareil, sauf si vous les partagez ou choisissez d’envoyer des commentaires. Paint by Moonlight n’a ni compte, ni publicité, ni suivi."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le tue foto e i tuoi quadri restano su questo dispositivo, a meno che tu non li condivida o scelga di inviare un feedback. Paint by Moonlight non ha account, pubblicità né tracciamento."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写真や絵は、共有したりフィードバックを送ったりしないかぎり、このデバイスに残ります。Paint by Moonlightにはアカウントも広告もトラッキングもありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사진과 그림은 직접 공유하거나 피드백을 보내기로 하지 않는 한 이 기기에만 머물러요. Paint by Moonlight에는 계정도, 광고도, 추적도 없어요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je foto’s en schilderijen blijven op dit apparaat, tenzij je ze deelt of ervoor kiest feedback te sturen. Paint by Moonlight heeft geen accounts, advertenties of tracking."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas fotos e pinturas ficam neste aparelho, a menos que você as compartilhe ou escolha enviar feedback. O Paint by Moonlight não tem contas, anúncios nem rastreamento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除非你分享它们或选择发送反馈，你的照片和画作都只保留在这台设备上。Paint by Moonlight 没有账户、广告或跟踪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除非你分享或選擇傳送意見回饋，否則你的照片和畫作都會留在這部裝置上。Paint by Moonlight 沒有帳號、廣告或追蹤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
